  &lt;/figcaption&gt;
 &lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;iframe allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen="" frameborder="0" height="480" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/QIqVVgy_M4A" title="추억의 80년대 한국광고 조이콤 | 전설의 마케팅 | 전마채널" width="100%"&gt;
